; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Adc\ssc\src\Adc.c	  3736  ** Syntax           : Std_ReturnType Adc_SetPowerState                        **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Adc\ssc\src\Adc.c	  3737  **                    (                                                       **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Adc\ssc\src\Adc.c	  3738  **                      Adc_PowerStateRequestResultType * const Result        **
